            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"define-and-initialize-the-decision-variables\">Define and initialize the decision variables</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x_{ij}:||)</marimo-tex> Binary variable indicating if region <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(j||)</marimo-tex> is served by warehouse <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i||)</marimo-tex><br>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(y_{i}:||)</marimo-tex> Binary variable indicating if warehouse <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i||)</marimo-tex> is opened<br></span></span>"
