          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"define-and-implement-the-relevant-constraints\">Define and implement the relevant constraints</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Regions can only be served by open warehouses:<br></span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[x_{ij} \\leq y_{i} \\quad \\forall i\\in W, j\\in R||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">Each region has to be served by exactly one warehouse:<br></span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\\sum_{i\\in W} x_{ij} = 1 \\quad \\forall j\\in R||]</marimo-tex></span>"
